{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17853","headline":"将赴洛下旅次汉南献上相公二十兄言怀八韵 · 令狐楚","name":"将赴洛下旅次汉南献上相公二十兄言怀八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台室名曾继，旌门节暂过。\n欢情老去少，苦事别离多。\n便爲开樽俎，应怜出网罗。\n百忧今已失，一醉孰知他。\n帝德千年日，君恩万里波。\n许随黄绮辈，闲唱紫芝歌。\n龙衮期重补，梅羹伫再和。\n嵩丘来携手，君子意如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}